# Map and county data

Read `docs/memory/workflows/farms-and-vault.md` and `docs/memory/workflows/cad-observation.md`.

- Archie is Story Pro only. Do not move or rebuild Corridors (live inside Research Access).
- Never write `county_parcels` from Farms, Vault, Prospects, or CRM.
- CAD is public tax-roll observation, not MLS and not verified deed history.
- Keep evidence tiers: KNOWN / CALCULATED / ESTIMATED / OBSERVED / VERIFY / UNKNOWN.
- Farms watch a territory and review changes. Study Vault stores studies and map photos. Different jobs.
- Map camera errors (LngLat) must not appear as red code on screen. A failed photo snap must not delete the save.
- Save to Vault stays on the map. Open Vault is its own click.
